    train: an owner sign-off at a member's exact SHA is its review provenance (R-0618), with a pure-merge check of the train head
    
    scripts/land/signoff.sh records and verifies refs/owner-signoff/<sha> (owner quote, date, SHA, the
    three reviewers' verdict outputs with sha256). review_provenance accepts it for a member without a
    clean note, then requires the head to be exactly the clean merge of the members onto the base.
    Controls: another commit, a changed verdict file, no agy verdict, a REJECT output, a quote naming no
    commit, an extra commit and a changed merge tree. The hook takes sign-off pushes in its notes tier.
    WIP: sandbox_isolation's linked-worktree run of review_tool.sh fails one check (being fixed).
